    <button onclick="openStoryModal('Sita Thapa','TRADITIONAL POTTER • BHAKTAPUR','/images/sitathapa.jpg','Born into a family of potters in the narrow lanes of Bhaktapur, the wheel was my first teacher and clay my first language. Each vessel I throw carries the memory of my grandmother\'s hands guiding mine. Through HeritEdge, my craft has traveled to homes across continents — and with every sale, I can send my daughter to school. This is what it means to preserve: not just an art form, but a way of life.')"
